# Flow-owned behavior: no redundant same-named Action required.
Flow Bootstrap conversation
Id samples.flow-owned.bootstrap

  Screen Start conversation
  Id samples.flow-owned.start

  Screen Restore conversation
  Id samples.flow-owned.restore

  Receives
    Session

  Rules
    Bootstrap the conversation only once per session
    User profile failure must not block the conversation
    Conversation history failure must block the conversation

  Uses
    Provider OpenAI

  Steps
    At the same time
      Load the user profile
      Load the conversation history for the session

    Once the conversation history is loaded
      If the conversation history is empty
        Go to samples.flow-owned.start
      Otherwise
        Go to samples.flow-owned.restore

  If bootstrap fails
    Shows
      Conversation error with retry

  Outcome
    Conversation is ready to start or continue
